 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Verdure — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you can create a circle of flower petals that surrounds your opponents and removes their will to fight. As an action for 5 Cursed Energy, you create a 30 ft diameter circle in a point within 100 feet of yourself, all creatures within that circle must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure they are charmed for 1 minute as their will to fight is completely drained and their mind enters a state of tranquility and happiness. While charmed in this way, they are unable to take any kind of actions that would help in the battle. A creature can repeat the save at the beginning of its turn or when they take damage. Any attacks against a charmed creature is made at advantage, and any saving throws other than saves against this feature the creature makes are at disadvantage.  </p>",
